[278.022, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ Both modes work. Repel bends the asteroid belt, but the gravity well reaches too far and over-saturates, so\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I'm tightening it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[283.115, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mRan 1 shell command\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  ⎿  Bash(python3 - <<'EOF')\u001b[0m\r\n"]
